# Bug 999 step definitions — the two branches.
#
# `the actual behavior is observed`   = buggy reality (must hold).
# `the expected behavior is observed` = intended reality, marked [inverted]
#                                       so it is expected to FAIL while the
#                                       bug is present (checked-but-inverted).

Composite: the actual behavior is observed
  Then I should see the message "Honky dory!"

Composite: the expected behavior is observed   [inverted]
  Then I should see the message "All good!"
